hadiths[112]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2015","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn chyzwn say rwzh dar ka rwzh nhyn twtta: synh lgana، qay krna awr rat ka akhraj۔ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay kh yh rwayt hay js myn kwyy aatbar nhyn hay، as kay mrsl abdalrhmn bn hyn۔ zyd kw zayf mhds qrar dya ja rha hay۔"
"2016","sabt albnany nay kha kh jb ans bn. malk say pwchha gya kh kya wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn rwzh dar kay lyay sngy lganay kw napsnd krtay hyn، anhwn nay jwab dya، \nhyn، swayay as kay kh as ka asr kmzwr hw۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
"2017","bkhary nay mkml snd kay bghyr kha hay kh abn amr rwzay ky halt myn syngy lgwatay thay۔ phr as nay asay trk kr dya awr rat kw synh lgaya۔"
"2018","ataa nay kha kh agr kwyy apna mnh kly kray awr as myn mwjwd pany nkal kr laab ngl lay awr jw kchh as myn rh jayay as say asay kwyy nqsan nhyn hwga lykn mswrhwn kw chbanay say gryz nhyn krna chahyay، agrchh myn yh nhyn khta kh as nay mswrhwn say pyda hwnay wala laab ngl lya tw phr bhy as say mna hay۔ bkhary nay asay ayk bab kay anwan myn nql kya hay۔"
"2019","aayshh nay kha kh hmzh bn amrw aslmy nay jw rwzay kay bht zyadh shwqyn thay، nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kya sfr myn rwzh rkhna chahyay، tw jwab mla: \agr chahw tw rwzh rkhw، ya chahw tw aftar krw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""
"2020","abw sayd khdry khtay hyn kh jb wh swlhwyn rmzan kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ghzwh pr nklay tw baz nay rwzh rkha awr baz nay aftar kya lykn dwnwn fryqwn myn say ksy ayk kw ayb nhyn mla۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2021","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk sfr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk hjwm awr ayk aadmy kw dykha jsay sayay myn rkha gya tha۔ wjh pwchhnay pr awr btaya gya kh myn rwzay say hwn، aap nay frmaya: sfr myn rwzh rkhna nyky ka hsh nhyn hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2022","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sfr myn jb an myn say kchh rwzh dar thay awr kchh nay aftar kya tw wh ayk grm dn myn ayk mqam pr atray awr rwzh darwn nay aftar krnay walwn kw atha kr khymay lgayay awr swarwn kw pany playa، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jn lwgwn nay aaj ka rwzh aftar kya an sb ka swab hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2023","abn abas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mdynh say mkh chlay gyay awr asfan phnchnay tk rwzh rkha۔ as kay bad aap nay pany mngwaya awr asay awpr athaya takh lwg asay dykhyn، aap nay rwzh twr dya awr mkh phnchnay tk asay dwbarh shrwa nhyn kya، awr wh rmzan myn tha۔ abn abas rzy allh anhma kha krtay thay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rwzh rkha awr aftar kya tw jw chahay rwzh rkhay awr jw chahay aftar kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2024","Roman Urdu:\nNarrated by Muslim from Jabir:\n\Us ne dopahar ki namaz ke baad pila diya.\"""""
"2025","ans by malk alkaby rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh nay msafr ky aadhy nmaz awr msafr kay lyay rwzh، shyr khwar bchay kw dwdh planay waly awrt awr hamlh awrt pr maaf kr dya hay۔ abwdaod، trmzy، nsayy awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2026","slamh by۔ almhbyq nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh: \agr ksy kay pas swary wala janwr hw jw asay as jgh lay jayay jhan asay kafy khana mysr hw tw asay chahyay kh rmzan kay rwzay jhan bhy aayay rkhay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
"2027","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm fth kay sal rmzan almbark myn mkh kay lyay rwanh hwyay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay awr lwgwn nay rwzh rkha yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm qr alghasm phnchay، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pany ka ayk pyalh mngwaya jsay lwgwn nay dykha، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay py lya۔ as kay bad aap kw btaya gya kh kchh lwgwn nay rwzh rkha hwa hay، awr kha: yh nafrman hyn، yhy nafrman hyn۔ * mkh say mdynh kay rastay pr dw mnzlh wady۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2028","abdalrhmn by۔ awf rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: sfr myn rmzan kay rwzay rkhnay wala aysa hay jysay sfr nh krtay hwyay aftar kray۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2029","hmzh by amrw aslmy nay khda kay rswl kw btaya kh as nay apnay aap kw sfr kay dwran rwzh rkhnay kay lyay kafy mzbwt paya awr pwchha kh kya aysa krna an kay lyay ghlt hwga؟ asay btaya gya kh khda ky trf say ajazt dy gyy hay jw azym awr shan wala hay، lhza agr kwyy as pr aml kray tw as nay achha kya، lykn agr kwyy rwzh rkhna chahay tw wh gnah ka mrtkb nhyn hwga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2030","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh jb an kay pas rmzan kay rwzwn ka kchh hsh hw tw wh srf shaban myn hy kr skyn gy۔ yhyyٰ by۔ sayd nay kha kh as ka mtlb yh hay kh asay as say mna kya gya tha js ky wjh say as ky zmh dary nby sly allh alyh wslm thy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2031","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”awrt kay lyay jayz nhyn kh as ka shwhr as ky ajazt kay bghyr rwzh rkhay awr wh ksy kw as ky ajazt kay bghyr apnay ghr myn dakhl hwnay ky ajazt nhyn day skty۔ *as say mrad rmzan nhyn hay blkh ayk fazl rwzh hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2032","maazh aladwyh khty hyn kh jb anhwn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say pwchha kh hyz aanay walay kw apnay rwzay ky qza kywn krny chahyay lykn nmaz ky nhyn، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh hmaray sath aysa hy hwa awr hmyn rwzay ky qza ka hkm dya gya lykn nmaz ky qza ka hkm nhyn dya gya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2033","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs as halt myn mr jayay kh as ky trf say kchh rwzay ada kyay gyay hwn tw as kay wars kw as ky trf say rwzh rkhna chahyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2034","nafa، abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs as halt myn mr jayay kh as nay rmzan kay rwzay rkhay hwn tw as ky trf say hr rwz kay bdlay ayk mskyn kw khana khlaya jayay۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha hay kh yh abn amr say zyadh pychhay nhyn hay۔"
"2035","malk nay kha kh myn nay sna hay kh abn amr say pwchha jata tha kh kwyy dwsray ky trf say rwzh rkh skta hay ya nmaz prh skta hay، tw jwab dytay thay kh nh rwzh rkh skta hay awr nh hy dwsray ky trf say nmaz prh skta hay۔ as nay asay almwta myn mntql kya۔"
"2036","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as qdr rwzh rkhtay thay kh hm smjhtay thay kh aap kbhy rwzh nhyn rkhyn gay، awr aap sly allh alyh wslm as qdr rwzh rkhtay thay kh hmara khyal tha kh wh kbhy rwzh nhyn rkhyn gay، myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw rmzan kay alawh ksy mhynay myn pwra rwzh rkhtay hwyay nhyn dykha، awr myn nay aap kw shaban say zyadh ksy mhynay myn rwzh nhyn dykha۔ ayk rwayt myn anhwn nay kha kh wh pwray shaban kay rwzay rkhtay thay yany thwra sa shaban kay alawh baqy tmam rwzay rkhtay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2037","abdallh by۔ shqyq khtay hyn kh jb myn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say pwchha kh kya nby sly allh alyh wslm pwray mhynay kay rwzay rkhtay thay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay aap sly allh alyh wslm kw rmzan kay alawh kbhy pwray mhynay kay rwzay rkhnay ka alm nhyn kya awr nh hy aap sly allh alyh wslm ky wfat tk hr mhynay kay kchh hsay kay rwzay rkhnay ka alm hwa۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2038","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha، ya yh kh aap nay amran ky smaat myn ayk aadmy say pwchha kh flan kay wald، kya aap nay shaban kay aakhry dn ka rwzh nhyn rkha؟ jb aap nay jwab dya kh myn nay nhyn rkha tw aap nay frmaya: \agr tm nay rwzh nhyn rkha tw dw dn kay rwzay zrwr rkhw۔\"" * *as rwayt kw abwhryrh ky s420 kay hashyh say mwafqt krnay kay lyay yh tjwyz kya gya hay kh as shkhs nay rwzh rkhnay ky nzr many thy، ya yh as ka dstwr tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"2039","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”rmzan kay bad sb say afzl rwzh allh kay mhynay mhrm ka hay، awr frz kay bad sb say afzl nmaz rat ky nmaz hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2040","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ksy dn ka rwzh rkhtay hwyay nhyn dykha، swayay as dn kay، aashwrh kay dn awr as mhynay kay، yany rmzan ka mhynh۔ *10 mhrm alhram۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2041","anhwn nay kha kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aashwrh kay dn rwzh rkha awr asay rwzh rkhnay ka hkm dya tw aap kw btaya gya kh yh ayk aysa dn hay jsay yhwd w nsaryٰ nay tazym myn rkha awr frmaya kh agr myn aglay sal tk bch gya tw myn nwyn tarykh ka rwzh rkhwn ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2042","am alfzl bnt hars khty hyn kh arfh kay dn an kay qryb kchh lwgwn nay as bat pr bhs ky kh kya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm rwzay say hyn، kchh nay kha kh wh hyn awr kchh nay kha kh wh nhyn hyn۔ chnanchh as nay asay dwdh ka ayk pyalh bhyja jb wh arfh myn apnay awnt pr thhray hwyay thay awr as nay asay py lya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2043","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw zwalhjh kay phlay ds dnwn myn rwzh rkhtay hwyay nhyn dykha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2044","abw qtadh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb ayk aadmy nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr pwchha kh aap nay rwzh kysay rkha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm ky batwn pr aap kw ghsh aaya، awr jb amr rzy allh anh nay ghsh dykha tw frmaya: hm allh kay rb hwnay، aslam kay dyn pr awr mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay nby hwnay pr razy hyn، hm allh awr as kay rswl kay ghzb say allh ky pnah mangtay hyn۔ amr rzy allh anh yh alfaz dhratay rhay yhan tk kh aap ka ghsh thnda hw gya، phr pwchha: ya rswl allh، hmyshh rwzh rkhnay walay ky kya hysyt hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh wh nh rwzh rkhay awr nh aftar kray! ya frmaya: as nay nh rwzh rkha awr nh hy aftar kya۔ aap nay pwchha kh hr tyn myn say dw rwzay rkhnay walay ky kya hysyt hay؟ awr jwab mla، \kya kwyy aysa kr skta hay؟\"" as nay pwchha kh hr dwsray dn rwzh rkhnay walay ky kya hysyt hay awr asay btaya gya kh yh why rwzh tha jw dywd nay rkha tha۔ as nay pwchha kh hr tyn myn say ayk dn rwzh rkhnay walay ky kya hysyt hay، tw khda kay rswl nay jwab dya، \""kash mjhay as ky pabndy krnay ky taqt dy jaty۔\"" as kay bad frmaya kh hr mhynay awr hr sal rmzan kay tyn dn kay rwzay rkhna ayk daymy rwzh hay، myn khda say amyd krta hwn kh arfh kay dn ka rwzh pchhlay awr aanay walay sal kay gnahwn ka kfarh bn jayay awr myn khda say chahta hwn kh ywm aashwrh ka rwzh pchhlay sal kay gnahwn ka kfarh hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"2045","Roman Urdu:\nNarrated by Muslim:\nJab maulaana Rasoolullah ko poochha gaya ki roza karene ka tarika kya hain, usne kaha: \Is din par main paida hua tha aur is din first time revelation mujh par send kiya gaya tha.\"""""
"2046","maazh aladwyh khty hyn kh anhwn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say pwchha kh kya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hr mhynay tyn rwzay rkhtay thay، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh aap nay aysa hy kya۔ as nay pwchha kh as nay mhynay myn kn dnwn myn rwzh rkha، tw as nay jwab dya kh asay as bat ky prwah nhyn kh mhynay kay kn dnwn myn rwzh rkha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2047","abw aywb ansary rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay rmzan kay rwzay rkhay awr as kay bad shwal kay chh rwzay rkhay tw yh hmyshh kay rwzay kay brabr hw ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2048","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rmzan kay aftar awr qrbany kay dn rwzh rkhnay say mna frmaya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2049","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh \dw dnwn myn rwzh nhyn rkha jayay ga، alftr awr alazhy۔* * as rwayt myn myn nay arby alfaz astamal kyay hyn، lykn an ka trjmh sabqh rwayt myn kya hay، sabqh rwayt myn alnhr astamal hwa hay jhan alazhyٰ astamal hwyy hay، alazhyٰ ka many hay mzlwm۔ (bkhary w mslm)۔"""
"2050","nwbyshh alhdly nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \ ayam tshryq* khanay، pynay awr zkr alhy kay dn hyn۔\"" *dswyn zy alhjh kw qrbany kay tyn dn۔ kha jata hay kh yh nam as lyay dya gya hay kh mtasryn kay gwsht kw ptywn myn kat kr dhwp myn khshk krnay kay lyay rkha jata hay۔ lykn dygr wzahtyn bhy dy jaty hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"2051","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya۔ ’’tm myn say kwyy shkhs jmah kay dn rwzh nh rkhay ala yh kh wh ayk dn phlay ya prswn rwzh rkhay‘‘۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2052","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh frman nql kya kh jmarat ky rat kw abadt kay lyay mkhsws nh krw awr jmah kw rwzay kay lyay mkhsws nh krw، ala yh kh tm myn say kwyy rwzay ky halt myn hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2053","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs jhad myn mshghwl hw kr ayk dn ka rwzh rkhay ga tw allh taalyٰ asay jhnm say str sal ky msaft dwr kr day ga۔ * lfzy twr pr، 'as ka chhrh'۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2054","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ jysa kh allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: kya mjhay khbr nhyn hwyy kh abdallh، tm dn kw rwzh rkhtay hw awr rat kw nmaz kay lyay athtay hw؟ jb aap nay jwab dya kh aysa hy hay tw aap nay frmaya: aysa nh krw، rwzh rkhw awr aftar krw، nmaz kay lyay athw awr sw jao، kywnkh tmhara jsm، apny aankh، bywy awr apnay mhmanwn pr frz hay، hmyshh rwzh rkhnay wala kbhy bhy rwzh nh rkhay! mhynh۔\ jb as nay jwab dya kh myn as say zyadh kr skta hwn tw aap nay frmaya: \""sb say afzl rwzh rkhw، daod ka، hr dwsray dn rwzh rkhw، awr hr sat ratwn myn ayk bar qraan prhw، lykn as say zyadh nh krw۔\"" * sy ayf۔ asy trh ka jmlh abw qtadh (s 434) ky rwayt myn hay۔ baz ka khyal hay kh yhan many yh hay kh js nay hmyshh rwzh rkha as nay rwzh nhyn rkha(bkhary wmslm)"""
"2055","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm swmwar awr jmarat kw rwzh rkhtay thay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2056","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mrdwn kay aamal swmwar awr jmarat kw pysh kyay jatay hyn awr myn psnd krta hwn kh myray aamal rwzay ky halt myn pysh kyay jayyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"2057","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm mhynay myn tyn dn rwzh rkhw tw abwzr tyrhwyn، chwdhwyn awr pndrhwyn kw rwzh rkhw“۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2058","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hr mhynay kay phlay tyn dn rwzh rkha krtay thay awr jmah kay dn rwzh twrtay thay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay nql kya hay awr abwdaod nay \hr mhynay tyn dn tk\"" nql kya hay۔"""
"2059","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk mhynay myn hfth، atwar awr pyr kw awr aglay mngl، bdh awr jmarat kw rwzh rkhtay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"2060","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm anhyn hr mhynay tyn dn kay rwzay rkhnay ka hkm dytay thay js ky shrwaat pyr ya jmarat say hwty thy۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2061","mslm alqrshy nay kha kh myn nay ya ksy awr nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say daymy rwzay kay baray myn pwchha tw aap nay jwab dya: \tm pr apnay ahl w ayal ka frz hay، rmzan awr as kay aglay mhynay awr hr bdh awr jmarat kay rwzay rkhw، as kay bad tm ayk daymy rwzh rkhw gay۔\"" asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"2062","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay arfh kay dn arfh myn rwzh rkhnay say mna frmaya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2063","abdallh by۔ bsr nay apny bhn smaa say rwayt ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hfth kay dn rwzh nh rkhw swayay as kay jw tm pr frz kya gya hay، awr agr tm myn say ksy kw angwr ky khal ya drkht say lkry kay tkray kay swa kchh nh mlay tw asay chahyay kh asay chba lay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod، trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2064","abw amamh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs jhad ky halt myn ayk dn ka rwzh rkhta hay، tw allh taalyٰ as kay awr jhnm kay drmyan aasman w zmyn kay drmyan atny chwry khndq dal dyta hay jtna kh faslh hay۔ *myrqat yh many dyta hay، lykn khta hay kh as say mrad hj، amrh، hswl alm، ya khda ky khwshnwdy ky khwahsh hay۔ arby 'khda ky rah myn' hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"2065","aamr by۔ msawd nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya، \srdywn myn rwzh rkhna ghnymt hay bghyr ksy msybt kay۔ khyal yh hay kh grmywn ky trh srdywn myn bhwk awr pyas nhyn lgty۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay nql kya hay، mokhr alzkr yh mrsl rwayt hay۔"""
"2066","qrbany kay bab myn abwhryrh rzy allh anh ky rwayt \khda kw kwyy dn zyadh mhbwb nhyn hay\""* *zwalhjh kay mhynay kay phlay ds dnwn ka hwalh hay۔"""
"2067","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mdynh tshryf layay awr yhwdywn kw ywm aashwrh ka rwzh rkhtay hwyay dykha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh as dn ky kya ahmyt hay، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh yh wh azym dn hay js myn allh taalyٰ nay mwsyٰ awr an ky qwm kw njat dy awr frawn awr as ky qwm kw ghrq kr dya، asy trh hm nay bhy mwsyٰ alyh alslam ka rwzh rkha۔ as nay kha، \hm zyadh hq rkhtay hyn، awr hmara mwsyٰ kay sath aap say zyadh qryby talq hay،\"" tw khda kay rswl nay asay khwd rwzh kay twr pr rkha awr asay rkhnay ka hkm dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"2068","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hfth awr atwar kw dwsray dnwn ky nsbt zyadh rwzh rkhtay thay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm frmatay thay kh yh mshrkyn kay lyay thwar kay dn hyn awr myn an kay khlaf aml krna psnd krty hwn۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2069","jabr by۔ smrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmyn ywm aashwrh kw rwzh rkhnay ka hkm dytay thay، hmyn as ky pabndy krnay ky tlqyn krtay thay awr jb wh aata tha tw hmary trf twjh krtay thay، lykn jb rmzan frz hwa tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn as kay rkhnay ka nh hkm dya، nh mna kya awr nh hy as ky trf twjh ky۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2070","hfsh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay char chyzyn kbhy trk nhyn kyn: aashwrh kay rwzay، zwalhjh kay phlay ds dn awr hr mhynay myn tyn dn، awr tlwa fjr say phlay dw rkatyn prhna۔ *arby myn srf 'ds' hay، jysa kh awpr trjmh kya gya hay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2071","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka mamwl tha kh wh mhynay kay drmyany dnwn myn khana nh khatay thay khwah sfr myn hw ya nh hw۔ * lfzy twr pr، sfyd kay dn (rat)۔ yh mhynay ky tyrhwyn، chwdhwyn awr pndrhwyn ratwn kay bad kay dn hyn، wh ratyn jb zyadh chandny hwty hay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2072","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr chyz pr zkw hay awr jsm ky zkw rwzh hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2073","anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm swmwar awr jmarat kw rwzh rkhtay thay، jb ksy nay aap say yh bat khy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” swmwar awr jmarat kay dn allh taalyٰ hr mslman kw bkhsh dyta hay swayay an dw kay jn myn akhtlaf hw، kywnkh as ka frman hay kh jb tk wh aaps myn slh nh kr lyn anhyn chhwr dya jayay۔ asay ahmd awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2074","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh ’’jw shkhs allh kw khwsh krnay ky khwahsh myn ayk dn ka rwzh rkhta hay tw allh taalyٰ asay jhnm say as trh dwr kr dyta hay js trh kwa jwan prnday say lay kr brhapay myn mrnay tk arta hay۔‘‘ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2075","byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn slmh say nql kya hay۔ qys"
"2076","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk dn mjh say mlnay aayay awr pwchha kh kya myray pas kchh hay؟ jb myn nay kha kh myray pas kchh nhyn hay tw as nay jwab dya kh phr myn rwzh rkhwn ga۔ jb wh ayk awr dn myray pas aaya awr myn nay asay btaya kh mjhay kchh hs ka thfh dya gya hay* tw as nay kha mjhay dkhao kywnkh myn nay dn ka aaghaz rwzh say kya tha۔ phr as nay khaya۔ *khjwr awr wazh mkhn ka mrkb۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2077","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm am slym rzy allh anha kay pas gyay، jb wh an kay lyay kchh khjwryn lay kr aayyn awr mkhn saf kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apna mkhn as kay brtn myn rkh dw awr apny khjwryn an kay brtn myn rkhw، kywnkh myn rwzay say hwn۔ as kay bad wh ghr kay alg hsay myn gyay awr ayk aysy nmaz prhy jw frz nmazwn myn say nhyn thy، awr am slym awr an kay ghr walwn pr drwd bhyja۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"2078","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kw rwzay ky halt myn khanay ky dawt dy jayay tw wh khay kh myn rwzay say hwn۔ ayk rwayt myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jb tm myn say ksy kw dawt mlay tw asay qbwl kr lyna chahyay، agr rwzay say hw tw nmaz prhay، lykn agr nhyn tw kha lay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2079","am hany rzy allh anha frmaty hyn kh fth mkh kay dn fatmh rzy allh anha aayyn awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay bayyn awr am hany aap kay dayyn trf bythyn، awr jb lwndy ayk brtn lay kr aayy۔ pany pya awr asay dya، as myn say kchh pya awr am hany kw day dya js nay as myn say kchh pya۔ as kay bad as nay kha: aay khda kay rswl، myn rwzh say thy awr myn nay apna rwzh twr dya۔ as nay pwchha kh kya wh ksy chyz ky qza kr rhy hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh nhyn hay، tw as nay kha، \agr yh nfly rwzh tha tw as say aap kw kwyy nqsan nhyn hwga۔\"" asay abwdaod، trmzy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔ ahmd awr trmzy ka ayk nskhh bhy kchh aysa hy hay۔ as myn as nay kha، \""khda kay rswl، myn rwzay say thy،\"" aap nay jwab dya، \""jw nfly rwzh rkhta hay wh as ka apna malk hay، wh chahay tw rwzh rkhay، awr chahay tw aftar kray۔\"""""
"2080","zhry nay arwh say rwayt ky hay kh aayshh nay kha: jb myn awr hfsh rwzay say thay tw hmyn khana pysh kya gya jw hmyn bht psnd tha awr as myn say kchh kha lya۔ hfsh nay yh bat rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btayy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy awr dn rwzh rkh kr as ky qza kr lw۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay، lykn as nay mtadd hfaz ka zkr kya hay jw zhry ky rwayt say aayshh rzy allh anha say mrsl ky swrt myn nql krtay hyn، arwh ky snd kw chhwrtay hyn، awr yh shyh hay۔ abwdaod nay asay arwh kay mokl zmyl say arwh say aayshh rzy allh anha say nql kya hay۔ *wh rwayt psnd jw apny drst yaddasht kay lyay shhrt rkhtay hyn۔"
"2081","am amarh bnt kab rzy allh anha khty hyn kh ayk mrtbh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm an kay pas tshryf layay awr anhwn nay aap kay lyay khana mngwaya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay bhy khana chahyay۔ lykn jb as nay jwab dya kh wh rwzay say hay tw aap nay frmaya: jb lwg rwzh dar kay sath khana khatay hyn tw frshtay as pr drwd bhyjtay hyn yhan tk kh wh khana kha lyn۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2082","brydh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk mrtbh blal rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky ayadt kay lyay gyay jb wh sbh ka khana kha rhay thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an kw apnay sath aanay ky dawt dy، jb blal rzy allh anh nay jwab dya kh wh rwzay say hyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hm apna rzq kha rhay hyn awr blal ka rzq jnt myn hay، kya tm jantay hw، blal، tmhyn malwm hay kh jw shkhs rwzay rkhta hay as ky hdyan allh taalyٰ say maafy mangty hyn awr allh taalyٰ say maafy mangty hyn“۔ as kay pas؟\ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"""
"2083","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: lyl alqdr kw rmzan kay aakhry ashrh myn say ayk prany rat myn tlash krw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"2084","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay baz ashab nay khwab dykha kh lyl alqdr aakhry sat ratwn myn say hay، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn dykh rha hwn kh tmharay khwab aakhry sat ratwn myn mtfq hyn، lhza jw shkhs asay tlash kray wh aakhry sat ratwn myn kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2085","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: lyl alqdr kw rmzan ky aakhry ds ratwn myn akyswyn، tyyswyn awr pchyswyn ratwn myn tlash krw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"2086","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rmzan almbark ky phly ds ratyn abadt myn gzaryn awr drmyany ashrh ayk gwl trky khymay myn abadt myn gzary، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay sr athaya awr frmaya: ”myn nay as rat ky tlash myn phly ds ratyn abadt myn gzary hyn، phr myn nay drmyany ashrh ratyn gzary hyn، awr as kay bad mjhay yh btaya gya kh myn nay ashrh ky zyart ky۔ aakhry ashrh myn js nay myray sath abadt ky hw wh aakhry ds ratwn myn aysa kray kywnkh mjhay yh ratyn dkhayy gyyn phr asay bhwl gya lykn myn nay apnay aap kw sbh kay wqt pany awr mty myn sjdh krtay hwyay dykha hay as lyay asay aakhry ashrh myn tlash krw awr hr rat myn taq add kay sath tlash krw۔ as nay kha: as rat barsh hwyy، msjd jw ayk khjwr waly amart thy tpk pry، awr myry aankhwn nay akyswyn rat kay bad sbh kw khda kay rswl kw pany awr mty kay nshanat pyshany pr dykha۔ bkhary awr mslm as mwzwa pr mtfq hyn، lfz mslm ka hay \awr btaya gya kh yh aakhry ds hay\""، baqy bkhary ka hay۔"""
"2087","abdallh bn kay nskhay myn۔ anys nay kha kh yh tyyswyn rat thy۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2088","zrr b۔ hbysh nay kha: myn nay aby bn say swal kya۔ kab nay apnay bhayy abn msawd kay as qwl kay baray myn kha kh jw shkhs sal myn hr rat nmaz kay lyay athay ga wh lyl alqdr kw maray ga، awr anhwn nay jwab dya: \khda as pr rhm kray، as ka mtlb yh tha kh lwg apnay aap pr qnaat nh kryn، wh jantay thay kh yh rmzan ky aakhry rat thy awr dswyn rat thy۔\"" phr as nay bghyr ksy thfzat kay qsm khayy kh yh stayyswyn hay، awr jb myn nay pwchha، \""abwalmnzr، tm ks bnyad pr yh khtay hw؟\"" as nay jwab dya، \""as asharay (ya nshan) say js ky allh kay rswl nay hmyn atlaa dy thy، yany as dn swrj bghyr shaaa kay tlwa hwta hay۔\"" *ayk mtbadl، transmytr kw yqyn nh hw kh kwn sa lfz astamal hwa hay۔ *ayk mtbadl، transmytr kw yqyn nh hw kh kwn sa lfz astamal hwa hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"2089","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm aakhry ashrh ky ratwn myn dwsray dnwn say zyadh abadt krtay thay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"2090","anhwn nay kha kh jb aakhry ds ratyn shrwa hwyyn tw khda kay rswl nay khwd kw mzhby mshqwn kay lyay tyar kya، rat kw jagtay rhay awr apnay ghr walwn kw jgaya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2091","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say arz kya kh agr wh jan lay kh shb qdr kw kwn sy nmaz prhny chahyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aay allh tw maaf krnay wala hay awr maafy kw psnd krta hay، as lyay mjhay maaf kr day۔ ahmd، abn majh awr trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr trmzy nay asay shyh qrar dya hay۔"
"2092","abwbkrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”as (yany lyl alqdr) kw akyswyn، tyyswyn، pchyswyn، stayyswyn ya aakhry rat kw tlash krw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"2093","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say lyl alqdr kay baray myn pwchha gya tw aap nay frmaya: yh hr rmzan myn hwty hay۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh asay sfyan awr shabh nay abw ashaq ky snd say nql kya hay jw abn amr say zyadh pychhay nhyn hay۔"
"2094","abdallh by۔ anys nay byan kya kh as nay kha kh allh kay rswl myray pas shra myn ayk jgh hay jhan myn rhta hwn awr as myn khda ky hmd w sna prhta hwn lykn mjhay ayk rat ka hkm frmayyn jb myn asay chhwr kr as msjd myn aaon۔ as nay jwab dya tyyswyn rat kw aajao۔ as kay bytay say pwchha gya kh as kay wald kysa aml krtay thay tw anhwn nay kha kh wh asr ky nmaz prh kr msjd myn dakhl hwtay thay awr sbh ky nmaz prhnay tk asay ksy kam kay lyay nhyn chhwrtay thay۔ phr jb as nay sbh ky nmaz prhy tw as nay apnay janwr kw msjd kay drwazay pr paya، as pr swar hwa awr waps apnay shrayy alaqay myn chla gya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2095","abadh by۔ samt rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm anhyn lyl alqdr ky khbr dynay kay lyay bahr tshryf layay، lykn dw mslmanwn kw aaps myn jhgrtay hwyay paya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn lyl alqdr kay baray myn btanay aaya hwn، lykn flan flan ka jhgra hw gya awr as ka alm waps lay lya gya، yh mmkn hay kh tmharay lyay bhtr hw، as lyay satwyn awr panchwyn tarykh kw tlash krw۔ antyswan، stayyswan، awr pchyswan۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"2096","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jb lyl alqdr aaty hay tw jbrayyl alyh alslam frshtwn ky ayk jmaat kay sath nazl hwtay hyn jw hr as shkhs pr drwd bhyjtay hyn jw khray hw kr bythtay hyn awr allh kw yad krtay hyn jw azym awr bzrg hay۔ phr jb an kay thwar ka dn aata hay، yany js dn wh aftar krtay hyn، tw allh taalyٰ apnay frshtwn say an kay baray myn fkhr say khta hay kh aay myray frshtw، as mzdwr ky kya jza hay js nay apna kam mkml kr lya hw؟ wh jwab dytay hyn kh aay hmaray rb، as ky jza yh hay kh asay as ky pwry mzdwry dy jayay۔ wh khta hay kh myray frshtwn، myray mrd awr bndwn nay jw kchh myn nay an pr frz kya tha wh pwra kr dya awr phr aawaz blnd krtay hwyay nklay، apny taqt، jlal، azt، blndy awr blnd mqam say myn an kw zrwr jwab dwn ga۔ phr frmata hay waps aao kywnkh myn nay tmhyn maaf kr dya hay awr tmhary brayywn kw nykywn myn bdl dya hay۔ anhwn nay kha kh phr wh maafy hasl kr kay waps aa jayyn gay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"2097","Sayyida Aisha Radi Allahu Anha ne kaha ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashrah mein masjid mein I'tikaf karte the yahan tak ke Allah ne aap ko wapas bula liya, phir aap ke baad aap ki biwiyon ne bhi is amal ko jari rakha. Ise Imam Bukhari aur Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"2098","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sb say zyadh skhy thay awr rmzan almbark myn hr mmkn hd tk skhy thay۔ jbrayyl alyh alslam rmzan ky hr rat an say mlaqat krtay thay awr nby sly allh alyh wslm an kay pas qraan prhtay thay۔ jb jbrayyl alyh alslam an say mlay tw wh as hwa say zyadh skhy thay jw aazadanh chlty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2099","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh qraan hr sal ayk bar nby sly allh alyh wslm pr phnchaya jata tha، lykn js sal aap sly allh alyh wslm ky wfat hwyy as myn dw bar aysa kya gya۔ wh hr sal ds ratwn myn msjd myn njy abadt myn mshghwl rhtay thay، lykn js sal an ky wfat hwyy as sal bys ratwn myn yh abadt krtay thay۔ *myrqat nay tbsrh kya hay kh baz mfsryn khtay hyn kh yhan ghyrfaal astamal kya gya hay kywnkh wh shkhs js nay qraan mjyd kw nby sly allh alyh wslm tk phnchaya wh marwf tha، yany۔ jbrayyl۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"2100","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm msjd myn hwtay tw apna sr myray qryb rkhtay awr myn knghy kr lyta، awr aap ghr myn srf qzayay hajt kay lyay dakhl hwtay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2101","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb amr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as nzr kay baray myn mshwrh kya jw aap nay zmanh jahlyt myn msjd hram myn ayk rat gzarnay kay lyay ky thy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apny nzr pwry krw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"2102","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm rmzan ky aakhry ds ratwn myn msjd myn abadt krnay kay aady thay۔ lykn ayk sal as nay asay chhwr dya awr aglay sal bys ratwn myn as myn mshghwl rhay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"2103","abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay aby bn say rwayt kya hay۔ kab۔"
"2104","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay msjd myn abadt krnay ka aradh kya tw aap nay fjr ky nmaz prhy awr phr apny khlwt myn dakhl hw gyay۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2105","anhwn nay kha kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm msjd myn wqfh wqfh say bymarwn ky ayadt krtay thay awr aap bghyr twqf kay sydhay aagay say gzr jatay thay awr an ky ayadt krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2106","anhwn nay kha kh jw shkhs msjd myn wqfh wqfh kr rha hw as kay lyay snt yh nhyn hay kh wh ksy batl ky ayadt kray، nh jnazay myn shrkt kray، ya bywy kw chhwyay ya glay lgayay، ya zrwry kamwn kay alawh ksy awr kam kay lyay bahr nh jayay۔ bghyr rwzh kay msjd myn abadt ky kwyy mdt nhyn hay، awr asay ajtmaay msjd myn krna chahyay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"2107","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar Radi Allahu Anhuma ne kaha ke jab Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) I'tikaf karte the to aap ka bistar, ya ek chhota sa takhta, aap ke liye Towba ke sutoon ke peechhe bichha diya jaata tha. Ise Imam Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"2108","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as shkhs kay baray myn jw msjd myn wqfh wqfh say abadt krta hay، frmaya: ”wh gnahwn say baz aajata hay awr asay nyk aamal ka ajr as shkhs ky trh dya jata hay jysay tmam nyk aamal krnay walay“۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"2109","Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum mein se behtreen shakhs wo hai jisney Quran seekha aur (doosron ko) sikhaya.'' Bukhari ."
"2110","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tashrif laye jabkey ham suffa mein they. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum mein se kon pasand karta hai ke wo her roz subh ke waqt wadi Bat'haan ya wadi aqeeq jaey aur koi gunah aur qata rehmi  kiye baghair wahan se badi kohan wali do oontniyaan ley aaye ?'' ham ne arz kya, Allah ke Rasool ! ham sab usey pasand kartey hain, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum mein se koi subh ke waqt masjid kyon nahin aata ke wo Allah Taala ki kitab se do aayaten seekhey ya padhey , to ye uskey liye do oontniyon se behtar hai aur teen ( aayaten ( uskey liye teen ( oontniyon ( se aur chaar , chaar se behtar hain, aur wo jitni ziyada hongi , wo itni hi oontniyon se behtar hongi .'' rawahu Muslim ."
"2111","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke jab wo apney ghar jaey to wahan teen badi moti tazi hamila oontniyaan paey ?'' ham ne arz kya : ji haan ! aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum mein se koi shakhs apni Namaz mein teen aayaat padhta hai to wo ( teen aayaat ( uskey liye teen moti tazi hamila oontniyon se behtar hain.'' rawahu Muslim ."
"2112","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' mahir Quran , itaat guzar moazzaz likhney waley farishton ke sath hoga, aur jo shakhs atak atak kar Quran padhta hai aur wo is par dushwaar hota hai to uskey liye dohra ajr hoga .'' muttafaq aleh."
"2113","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' sirf do aadmiyon par rashk karna jayez hai, eik wo aadmi jisey Allah ne Quran (ka ilm ( ata kya ho aur wo din raat us ( ki tilawat w amal (ka ehtimam karta ho, aur eik wo aadmi jisey Allah ne maal ata kya ho aur wo din raat is mein se kharch karta ho.'' muttafaq aleh."
"2114","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Quran ki tilawat karney wala momin narangi ki tarah hai uski khushbu bhi achi hai aur wo khush zaiqa bhi hai, aur Quran ki tilawat na karney wala momin khajoor ki tarah hai, jiski khushbu nahin lekin uska zaiqa sheereen hai, aur Quran na padhney waley munafiq ki misal تمے ki tarah hai jiski khushbu nahin aur uska zaiqa kadwa hai jabkey Quran padhney wala munafiq naazboo ki tarah hai jiski khushbu achi hai aur zaiqa kadwa hai.'' muttafaq aleh. aur eik riwayat mein hai : '' Quran padhney aur is par amal karney wala momin turanjabin ki misl hai jabkey Quran na padhney wala lekin is par amal karney wala momin khajoor ki tarah hai.''"
"2115","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' be-shak Allah , is kitab ke zariey kuch logon ko bulandi ata farmata hai aur kuch logon ko pasti ka shikar kar deta hai.'' rawahu Muslim ."
"2116","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Usaid bin Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke eik dafa wo raat ke waqt Sura Baqra tilawat kar rahey they aur unka ghoda unke paas bandhaa hua tha ke ghoda achcha uchhalney laga , wo khamosh ho gaey to wo (ghodaa) bhi thehar gaya, unhoney phir padha to ghoda phir uchhalney laga wo khamosh ho gaey to wo (ghodaa) bhi thehar gaya. unhoney phir padha to ghoda phir uchhalney laga , wo farigh huye, aur unka beta Yahya us (ghodey) ke qarib hi tha, lihaza unhen andesha hua ke wo usey nuqsan na pahunchaey aur jab unhoney usey door kiya, aur aasman ki taraf sar uthaya to sayeban (saaya) sa dikhai diya jis mein chiraghon ki tarah roshni thi, jab subah hui to unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko bataya, to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''ibne Huzeer ! padh , ibne Huzeer ! tum padhtey rehtey.'' unhoney arz kiya Allah ke Rasool ! mujhey andesha hua ke (agar main padhta rehta to) wo Yahya ko raund daalta, kyonkey wo uskey qarib tha, lihaza main uski taraf mutawajjeh ho gaya, maine apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya to (ooper) sayeban (saye) ki tarah koi chiz thi aur is mein chiraghon jaisi koi chiz thi, main bahar nikla yahan tak ke maine us (roshni) ko na dekha, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum jantey ho wo kya tha?'' unhoney arz kiya, nahin, farmaya : ''wo farishtey they jo tumhari aawaz ke qarib aagey they, agar tum padhtey rehtey to wo wahin rehtey aur log unhen dekh letey aur wo un se makhfi (chhipey) na rehtey.'' muttafaq aleh. aur ye alfaz hadees Bukhari ke hain, aur Sahih Muslim mein hai : ''main bahar nikla'' seegha mutakallim ke badal lafz : ''wo fiza mein buland ho gaey'' istimal hua hai."
"2117","Hazrat Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain eik aadmi Sura kahaf padh raha tha, aur uskey eik janib eik ghoda do mazbut rassiyon se bandhaa hua tha, isliye badal ke tukdey ne us (aadmi) ko dhanp liya aur wo uskey qarib se qarib tar honey laga, jabkey uska ghoda bidakney laga , jab subah hui to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur aap se uska tazkira kiya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''wo sakeenat thi jo Quran ki wajeh se nazil hui thi.'' muttafaq aleh."
"2118","Hazrat Abu-Saeed bin Muallaa (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, main masjid mein Namaz padh raha tha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhey bulaya , maine aap ki aawaz par labbaik kahi, phir main aap ki khidmat mein hazir hua to maine arz kiya : Allah ke Rasool ! main Namaz padh raha tha, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya Allah ne nahin farmaya ! jab Allah aur uska Rasool tumhen bulaeyn to tum unki itaat karo.'' phir aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya main , is se pehley ke tum masjid se bahar niklo , tumhen Quran ki azeem sura na sikhaun?'' aapney mujhey haath se pakad liya , jab ham ne masjid se bahar nikalney ka irada kiya to maine arz kiya, Allah ke Rasool ! aapney farmaya tha ke main tumhen Quran ki azeem tar sura sikhaunga , aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''(الحمد للہ رب"
"2119","Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Radi Allahu Anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Apne gharona ko qabristaan na banao. Jis ghar mein Surah Baqarah parhi jaati hai us mein shaitan bhaag jaata hai.\"" Ise Muslim ne rivayat kiya."""
"2120","Hazrat Abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna ''Quran padha karo, kyonkey wo roze-qiyamat apney padhney walon ke liye sifarishi bin kar aaeyga, Sura Baqra aur Sura Aale-Imran do chamakti hui roshan Suraton ko padho, kyonkey wo qiyamat ke din is haal mein ayengi goya ke wo do badal hain ya do sayebaan hain ya parindon ke ghol hain jo safein baandhey huey apney padhney walon ke haq mein behes w mubaahasa karengey, Sura Baqra padha karo, kyonkey usey hasil kar lena baaise barkat aur isey tarak kar dena baaise hasrat hai, aur jadugar isey hasil nahin kar saktey.'' rawahu Muslim."
"2121","Hazrat Nawaas bin Samaan (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : ''Quran aur is par amal karney walon ko roze-qiyamat laya jaeyga, Sura Baqra aur Sura Aale-Imran is (Quran ki soorton) ke aagey hongi goya wo siyah badal hain ya do sayebaan hain unke darmiyan roshni hai, ya wo parindon ke do ghol hain jo safein baandhey huey apney padhney walon ki taraf se jhagda karen gi.'' rawahu Muslim."
"2122","Hazrat Ubai bin Kab (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''abu-Munzir! kya tum jantey ho ke tumhen Quran karim ki kon si sab se azeem aayat yad hai? ''maine arz kya, Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jantey hain, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne phir farmaya : ''abu-Munzir! kya tum jantey ho ke tumhen Quran karim ki kon si sab se azeem aayat yad hai? ''maine arz kya : (Allahu la Ilaah illa huwal hayyul-qayyum) Ubai bin Kab (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne merey seeney par haath maara aur farmaya : ''abu-Munzir ! tumhen ilm Mubarak ho.'' ( rawahu muslim) ."
"2123","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhey sadqa fitr ki hifazat karney par maamoor farmaya , pas eik shakhs merey paas aaya aur ghalley se lappein bharney laga, maine usey pakad liya aur kaha : main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas lekar jaaun ga , usney kaha : main mohtaj hun, merey bachey hain aur main bahut zarurat mand hun, raawi bayan kartey hain, maine usey chhod diya, subh hui to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Abu-Hurera ! guzishta raat terey qaidi ne kya kya ?'' maine arz kya, Allah ke Rasool ! usney sakht zarurat aur bachon ki shikayat ki to mujhey is par rehem aa gaya aur maine usey chhod diya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' usney tumharey sath ghalat bayaani ki aur wo phir aaeyga .'' maine jaan liya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke farman ke mutabiq wo phir aaeyga lihaza mein uski taak mein beth gaya, wo aaya aur ghalla bharney laga to maine usey pakad liya , aur maine kaha : main tumhen zarur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh karunga . usney kaha : main zarurat mand aur ayaal daar hun, main phir nahin aaunga. maine is par taras khatey huey usey chhod diya, subh hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujh se puchha : ''abu-Huraira ! tumharey qaidi ka kya hua ?'' maine arz kya, Allah ke Rasool ! usney sakht zarurat aur bachon ki shikayat ki to maine is par rehem khatey huey usey chhod diya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' usney to tum se ghalat bayaani ki aur wo phir aaeyga.'' maine jaan liya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke farman ke mutabiq wo zarur aaeyga . main uski taak mein beth gaya, wo aaya aur ghalla bharney laga to maine usey pakad liya aur kaha : main tumhen zarur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh karunga aur ye teesri aur aakhiri martaba hai, tum kehtey ho mein phir nahin aaunga lekin phir aa jatey ho, usney kaha mujhey chhod do , main tumhen chand kalmaat sikhaaunga jinkey zariey Allah tumhen faeyda pahunchaeyga. jab tum soney ke liye apney bistar par aao to mukammal aayatal-kursi padho, is tarah Allah ki taraf se tum par eik muhafiz muqarrar ho jaeyga aur shetan tumharey qarib nahin aaeyga yahan tak ke subh ho jaeygi, maine usey chhod diya, subh hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhey farmaya : '' tumharey qaidi ne kya kya?'' maine arz kya, usney kaha ke wo mujhey chand kalmaat sikhaeyga jinkey zariey Allah mujhey faeyda pahunchaeyga , aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' usney tum se sach kaha halanke wo jhoota hai, kya tum jantey ho ke tum teen roz se kis ke sath baaten kartey rahey ho ?'' maine arz kya, nahin, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' wo shetan tha.'' Bukhari."
"2124","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, us doran ke Jibrael (Alaihissalam) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas bethey huey they ke unhoney apney sar ke ooper se zor daar aawaz suni to unhoney apna sar uthaya aur farmaya : ''ye aasman se pehli martaba eik darwaza khula aur us se eik farishta nazil hua hai, Jibrael (Alaihissalam) ne farmaya : ye jo farishta zamin ki taraf nazil hua hai, us se pehley kabhi nazil nahin hua hai, usney salam arz kya, to kaha : aap ko do nooron ki khushkhabri ho, wo aap hi ko ata kiye gaey hain, aap se pehley kisi Nabi ko nahin diye gaey, Sura Fatiha aur Sura Baqra ki aakhiri ( teen ( aayaat , aap (aur aap ke muttabein) un dono mein se jo harf ( dua ( padhengey wo aap ko ata kar diya jaeyga.'' rawahu Muslim ."
"2125","Hazrat abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Sura Baqra ki aakhiri do aayaten aisi hain ke jo shakhs raat ke waqt unhen padh ley to wo uskey liye kafi ho jati hain.'' muttafaq aleh."
"2126","abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs swrh khf ky abtdaa myn ds aayat kw dl say sykhay ga wh djal say mhfwz rhay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
